  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Canadian postsecondary enrolments and graduates, <span class="refper">2024/2025</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/261001/dq261001a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/261001/dq261001a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-10-01T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In the 2024/2025 academic year, there were 2.3&#160;million enrolments in public colleges and universities, up slightly (+0.1%; +3,174) from the previous year. This followed a larger increase of 5.8% (+129,276&#160;enrolments) from 2022/2023 to 2023/2024.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
