      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Electric Power Selling Price Index, <span class="refper">July 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260908/dq260908d-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260908/dq260908d-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-09-08T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
