    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Primary energy production rose&#160;5.9% in June to 2.0&#160;million&#160;gigajoules, with all six&#160;sectors contributing to the increase.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
