    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Oilseed processors crushed 1.3&#160;million&#160;tonnes of canola in July, up 13.1% from June&#160;2026 and up 36.5% from July&#160;2025. Oil production reached 561.6&#160;thousand&#160;tonnes in July&#160;2026, while meal production was 764.2&#160;thousand&#160;tonnes.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
