    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In July, the Industrial Product Price Index increased 0.6% month over month and gained 12.4% year over year. Meanwhile, the Raw Materials Price Index decreased 2.2% month over month and increased 18.1% year over year. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
