    <updated>2026-08-19T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Data tables for Employment Insurance&#160;(EI) statistics have been updated to June&#160;2026. The EI series have been revised back to January&#160;2023 to reflect the most recent seasonal patterns and improved geographical allocation. These revised tables are now available on the Statistics Canada website. Data on EI for July&#160;2026 will be released on September&#160;17.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
