    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260807/dq260807b-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260807/dq260807b-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-08-07T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In 2025, the highest production levels for industrial chemicals were recorded for ethylene (5.7&#160;million&#160;tonnes, up 5.6% from 2024), anhydrous ammonia (4.8&#160;million&#160;tonnes, up 1.0%) and urea (4.0&#160;million&#160;tonnes, down 1.4%).</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
