    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260806/dq260806a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260806/dq260806a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-08-06T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Lumber production decreased 3.1% from April to 3&#160;869.8&#160;thousand cubic metres in May. Production was down 6.8% from May&#160;2025.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
