    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In June, 5.2&#160;million passengers passed through pre-board security screening at checkpoints operated at Canada's eight&#160;largest airports, edging up 0.6% from June&#160;2025.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
