  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Oilseed crushing statistics, <span class="refper">June 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260730/dq260730e-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260730/dq260730e-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-30T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Oilseed processors crushed 1.2&#160;million tonnes of canola in June, up 12.8% from May&#160;2026 and up 36.6% from June&#160;2025. Oil production reached 494.6&#160;thousand tonnes in June&#160;2026, while meal production was 684.1&#160;thousand tonnes.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
