    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The 2025 certified organic fruit and vegetable production estimates are now available.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Financial Information of Universities, <span class="refper">2024/2025</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729b-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729b-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-29T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Today, Statistics Canada is releasing data from the 2024/2025 Financial Information of Universities Survey. This release includes information on the sources of revenue and the nature of expenditures of Canadian universities. Data are available at the national, provincial and territorial levels.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Food services and drinking places, <span class="refper">May 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-29T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Total sales in the food services and drinking places subsector increased 0.9% in May to $8.8 billion. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Major grain deliveries, <span class="refper">June 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729c-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729c-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-29T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Deliveries of major grains across Canada rose by 17.8% in June from the same month the previous year, totalling 5.9&#160;million tonnes. Increases in canola (+28.1% to 2.1&#160;million tonnes), total wheat (+10.4% to 3.2&#160;million tonnes) and barley (+51.9% to 333.4&#160;thousand tonnes) contributed to higher deliveries. Saskatchewan accounted for half (50.0%) of all deliveries, while Alberta accounted for 29.7% and Manitoba accounted for 18.2%. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Milled wheat and wheat flour produced, <span class="refper">second quarter 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729d-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260729/dq260729d-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-29T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Millers milled 875&#160;000&#160;tonnes of wheat in the second&#160;quarter of&#160;2026, while wheat flour production totalled 695&#160;000&#160;tonnes. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Pension plans in Canada, <span class="refper">as of January 1, 2025</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260728/dq260728a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260728/dq260728a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-28T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The number of Canadians who were active members of a registered pension plan (RPP) grew by 132,000 (+1.8%) from 2023 to nearly 7.4&#160;million members in 2024. Employment grew by 394,200 (+2.1%) over the same period, according to the Labour Force Survey (LFS). </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Census of Environment: Wildfire experiences among Indigenous Peoples, <span class="refper">2021 to 2024</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260728/dq260728b-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260728/dq260728b-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-28T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Forest fires and wildfires are a regular occurrence in many areas of the country. These fires pose a threat to communities across the country and have particular impacts on First Nations people, M&#233;tis and Inuit.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Employment Insurance Beneficiaries in Rural and Small Town Canada: Interactive Dashboard, <span class="refper">May 2026</span></div>
