    <updated>2026-07-23T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Data tables for Employment Insurance&#160;(EI) statistics have been updated to May&#160;2026. These revised tables are now available on the Statistics Canada website. Data on EI for June&#160;2026 will be released August&#160;19.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
