    <updated>2026-07-20T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The total value of investment in building construction edged down $66.8&#160;million&#160;(-0.3%) to $23.4&#160;billion in May.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
