  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Canada's international transactions in securities, <span class="refper">May 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260717/dq260717a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260717/dq260717a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-17T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Foreign investors purchased $7.9&#160;billion of Canadian securities in May, down from a sizable $46.9&#160;billion investment in April. Meanwhile, Canadian investors acquired $22.3&#160;billion of foreign securities, following a divestment of $11.4&#160;billion in the previous month. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
