    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260715/dq260715a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260715/dq260715a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-15T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Manufacturing sales increased 1.3% in May, mainly on increased sales of motor vehicles and chemical products. Meanwhile, sales in the electrical equipment, appliance and component subsector declined the most.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
