    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260715/dq260715c-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-15T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">There are two new articles available in today's release of Health Reports.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">New motor vehicle sales, <span class="refper">May 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260715/dq260715d-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260715/dq260715d-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-15T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">There were 190,564&#160;new motor vehicles sold in Canada in May, a decrease of&#160;1.9% from the same month one&#160;year earlier. However, sales in dollar terms increased&#160;2.3% relative to May&#160;2025. Over the same period, the number of new trucks sold decreased by&#160;2.2%, while the number of new passenger cars sold edged up&#160;0.1%. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
