  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Leading indicator of international arrivals to Canada, <span class="refper">June 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260713/dq260713a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260713/dq260713a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-07-13T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In June, the preliminary number of international arrivals to Canada (Canadian-resident return trips, combined with US-resident and overseas-resident arrivals) by air and automobile totalled 5.5&#160;million, up&#160;3.6% from the same month in 2025. </div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Lending Services Price Index, <span class="refper">first quarter 2026</span></div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260713/dq260713b-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260713/dq260713b-eng.htm</id>
