    <updated>2026-06-30T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Oilseed processors crushed 1.0&#160;million tonnes of canola in May, down 1.5% from April&#160;2026 and up 24.7% from May&#160;2025. Oil production reached 446.7&#160;thousand tonnes in May&#160;2026, while meal production was 597.8&#160;thousand tonnes.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
