  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Study: Portrait of the Latin American populations in Canada</div>
    </title>
    <link href="https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260629/dq260629a-eng.htm"></link>
    <id>https://www.statcan.gc.ca/daily-quotidien/260629/dq260629a-eng.htm</id>
    <updated>2026-06-29T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">This portrait focuses on the analysis of the sociodemographic and socioeconomic outcomes of Latin American populations in Canada. An intersectional approach is applied to explore the relationships between multiple diversity factors, with the aim of providing a comprehensive overview of the diverse characteristics of Latin American populations living in Canada.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
