    <updated>2026-06-25T08:30:00-04:00</updated>
    <summary type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A new geospatial file on the human landscape modification index&#160;(HLMI) is now available for&#160;2020.</div>
    </summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title type="xhtml">
